+ * libc follows): 0 on success, 22 (EINVAL) for a null or overlapping argument, 34 (ERANGE) when the
+ * result does not fit, and the destination is emptied on either failure so a caller that ignores the
+ * code cannot read stale bytes. CUSA02716 imports all three (analysis.json index 83, 199, 590);
